    <string name="privacy_title">Privacy Policy – Status Saver</string>
    <string name="privacy_last_updated">Last Updated: May 04, 2026</string>

    <string name="privacy_section_1_heading">1. Data Privacy &amp; Collection</string>
    <string name="privacy_section_1">
    Your privacy is our primary concern. Our application does not collect, store, or share any personal identity information, private messages, or contact details. All core functions of the app are designed to work locally on your device to ensure maximum security.
</string>

    <string name="privacy_section_2_heading">2. Storage &amp; Folder Access</string>
    <string name="privacy_section_2">
    This application utilizes the standard Android Storage Access Framework. We only access the specific media directories that you manually select and authorize. We do not have permission to access your private files, documents, or personal gallery items outside of the authorized paths.
</string>

    <string name="privacy_section_3_heading">3. Essential Permissions</string>
    <string name="privacy_section_3">
    To ensure the app works as intended, we require the following: \n\n
    • Directory Access: To manage and save locally stored media files. \n
    • Network Access: To provide online content discovery and support app stability. \n
    • Notifications: To provide status updates regarding your saved media (optional). \n\n
    We do not request access to your Camera, Microphone, or Location.
</string>

    <string name="privacy_section_4_heading">4. Online Content Services</string>
    <string name="privacy_section_4">
    The application includes a discovery feature that allows you to browse public-domain media. Any search conducted within the app is used solely to provide relevant content results in real-time. We do not link your searches to any personal profile.
</string>

    <string name="privacy_section_5_heading">5. Advertising &amp; Analytics</string>
    <string name="privacy_section_5">
    We may display advertisements provided by regulated third-party ad networks. These partners may use non-personal, technical identifiers (such as an Advertising ID) solely to deliver and measure the performance of ads. No private media or user-generated data is ever shared with these providers.
</string>

    <string name="privacy_section_6_heading">6. Security &amp; Offline Integrity</string>
    <string name="privacy_section_6">
    Most features of this app operate in an offline environment. Because your media is not uploaded to any remote servers, your files remain strictly under your own control and ownership.
</string>

    <string name="privacy_section_7_heading">7. Children\'s Privacy</string>
    <string name="privacy_section_7">
    Our service is designed for a general audience. We do not intentionally target or collect data from individuals under the age of 13. We are committed to complying with all child protection regulations.
</string>

    <string name="privacy_section_8_heading">8. Support &amp; Inquiries</string>
    <string name="privacy_section_8">
    If you have any questions about this policy or how your data is handled, feel free to contact us: \n\n
    Email: mariaadeeb982@gmail.com
</string>

    <string name="disclaimer_heading">Legal Disclaimer</string>

    <string name="disclaimer_text">
    <b>1. Non-Affiliation:</b> \n
    This app is a third-party utility tool and is <b>NOT</b> affiliated with, sponsored by, or endorsed by any messaging platform or social media corporation. \n\n

    <b>2. Trademark Acknowledgment:</b> \n
    All product names, logos, and brands are property of their respective owners. Their use in this app is for identification and compatibility purposes only. \n\n

    <b>3. Usage Policy:</b> \n
    This tool is intended for personal use of locally stored media. Users are responsible for ensuring they have the legal right or permission from the original content owners before saving or redistributing any media. \n\n

    <b>4. Liability:</b> \n
    The developer shall not be held responsible for any misuse of the application or any copyright infringements committed by the user.
</string>

